"w":1801,"h":48},{"text":"Success!","x":285,"y":517,"w":205,"h":36},{"text":"Cabrillo USD public schools are where every child learns, grows, and gets the support","x":284,"y":626,"w":1813,"h":48},{"text":"to reach their full potential. Our schools help students build strong foundations, support","x":283,"y":681,"w":1831,"h":48},{"text":"student achievement, and provide opportunities for every student to succeed.","x":282,"y":737,"w":1626,"h":46},{"text":"Measure _ will help Cabrillo Unified attract and retain qualified, dedicated educators,","x":283,"y":846,"w":1772,"h":48},{"text":"strengthen career training and college readiness programs, and provide specialized","x":282,"y":902,"w":1758,"h":47},{"text":"reading and math instruction for younger students, so every child builds a strong","x":282,"y":957,"w":1689,"h":46},{"text":"foundation early.","x":280,"y":1013,"w":348,"h":45},{"text":"Measure Will:","x":282,"y":1122,"w":340,"h":37},{"text":"• Retain Top-Tier Educators: Maintain competitive wages and benefits to attract","x":351,"y":1205,"w":1752,"h":47},{"text":"and retain highly qualified teachers, counselors, specialized educators, and staff.","x":422,"y":1260,"w":1701,"h":46},{"text":"Expand Career Training Programs: Grow hands-on programs, including","x":423,"y":1343,"w":1553,"h":47},{"text":"agriculture, construction, and welding, that give students real skills for good-","x":421,"y":1398,"w":1601,"h":46},{"text":"paying jobs.","x":420,"y":1454,"w":251,"h":45},{"text":"Protect College Readiness Programs: Enhance the courses that help students","x":422,"y":1536,"w":1705,"h":47},{"text":"meet university requirements and graduate ready for higher education.","x":421,"y":1592,"w":1484,"h":48},{"text":"Measure _ Ensures Taxpayer Safeguards:","x":278,"y":1702,"w":940,"h":45},{"text":"• Guaranteed Local Funding: By law, Measure _ funds cannot be taken by the","x":348,"y":1784,"w":1720,"h":47},{"text":"State or Federal Government and spent elsewhere.","x":418,"y":1839,"w":1084,"h":45},{"text":"• Transparency and Accountability: Full public disclosure of all spending,","x":346,"y":1922,"w":1625,"h":47},{"text":"independent citizen oversight, and annual audits ensure responsible use of","x":418,"y":1977,"w":1584,"h":46},{"text":"funds.","x":415,"y":2033,"w":129,"h":36},{"text":"Senior Exemptions: Property owners 65 and older may qualify for an exemption","x":417,"y":2117,"w":1710,"h":46},{"text":"from the tax.","x":415,"y":2172,"w":263,"h":36},{"text":"No Administrator Salaries: Funds are prohibited from being used for","x":417,"y":2255,"w":1475,"h":48},{"text":"administrator salaries, pensions, or benefits.","x":415,"y":2311,"w":932,"h":46},{"text":"Measure protects taxpayers and seniors, retains highly qualified teachers, and","x":274,"y":2421,"w":1687,"h":47},{"text":"strengthens the career training and college readiness programs our students rely on","x":272,"y":2477,"w":1770,"h":46},{"text":"every day. Join parents, grandparents, guardians, teachers, neighbors, business","x":272,"y":2532,"w":1693,"h":47},{"text":"owners, and community leaders in voting YES on Measure _ to keep Coastside","x":271,"y":2587,"w":1714,"h":47},{"text":"schools strong and support student success.","x":271,"y":2643,"w":1031,"h":46},{"text":"13","x":2238,"y":598,"w":64,"h":63},{"text":"13","x":2235,"y":666,"w":53,"h":58},{"text":"(D","x":2215,"y":808,"w":60,"h":54},{"text":"to","x":2241,"y":1186,"w":44,"h":34},{"text":"10","x":2229,"y":1253,"w":48,"h":34},{"text":"9","x":2216,"y":1580,"w":31,"h":67},{"text":"9","x":2177,"y":1896,"w":35,"h":63},{"text":"6","x":2147,"y":2661,"w":33,"h":56}]}]}
